{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a solutions grid section with these EXACT specifications:
    
    WRAPPER:
    - Full width, max-width 100vw, overflow-x hidden
    - Background: white (#FFFFFF)
    - Padding: 128px top and bottom
    - Inner container: max-width 2200px, centered
    - Padding horizontal: 16px mobile | 24px sm | 48px lg | 80px xl
    
    HEADER SECTION:
    Subheading:
    - Text: "CAPABILITIES"
    - Font-size: 11px
    - Font-weight: 700
    - Uppercase, letter-spacing 0.4em
    - Color: black 40% opacity
    - Margin-bottom: 24px
    
    Main Heading:
    - Text: "Industrial Solutions."
    - Font-size: 36px mobile | 48px sm | 56px md
    - Font-weight: 900
    - Letter-spacing: tight
    - Color: black, but "Solutions." word is cyan (#00B9F1)
    - Margin-bottom: 32px
    
    Underline Accent:
    - Width: 96px
    - Height: 6px
    - Background: cyan (#00B9F1)
    - Margin-bottom: 48px
    
    SOLUTIONS GRID:
    - CSS Grid: 2 columns mobile | 3 columns md | 5 columns lg
    - Gap: 0 (no gap, using borders instead)
    - Border-top: 1px solid black 5% opacity
    - Border-left: 1px solid black 5% opacity
    - Small box-shadow on entire grid
    
    SOLUTION CARDS (10 total):
    - Padding: 24px mobile | 32px sm | 40px lg
    - Border-right: 1px solid black 5% opacity
    - Border-bottom: 1px solid black 5% opacity
    - Min-height: 200px mobile | 240px sm | 280px lg
    - Flex column, justify space-between
    - Background: transparent
    - Cursor: pointer
    - Position: relative
    - Overflow: hidden
    
    Font: Outfit (weights 700, 900)
    Ensure fully responsive, no horizontal scroll., Add content structure to each solution card:
    
    CARD TOP SECTION (flex row, space-between):
    
    ID Number (left side):
    - Text: "01", "02", "03", etc.
    - Font-size: 10px
    - Font-weight: 700
    - Color: black 20% opacity
    
    Tag Badge (right side):
    - Font-size: 9px
    - Font-weight: 900
    - Uppercase
    - Letter-spacing: wide
    - Padding: 4px 12px
    - Border-radius: full (pill shape)
    - Background: white
    - Small shadow
    - Border: 1px solid
    
    CARD BOTTOM SECTION:
    
    Title:
    - Font-size: 18px mobile | 20px sm | 24px lg
    - Font-weight: 900
    - Color: black
    - Margin-bottom: 16px
    
    CARD DATA (10 cards):
    01 | CORE | Brand Identity
    02 | DESIGN | Logo Design
    03 | DIGITAL | Web Design
    04 | CORE | Print Design
    05 | DESIGN | Packaging
    06 | DIGITAL | Marketing
    07 | CORE | Signage
    08 | DESIGN | Illustration
    09 | DIGITAL | Photography
    10 | CORE | Consulting, Add colors to tag badges based on type:
    
    CORE tags (cards 01, 04, 07, 10):
    - Border: cyan 20% opacity
    - Text: cyan-600 (#0891B2)
    
    DESIGN tags (cards 02, 05, 08):
    - Border: magenta 20% opacity
    - Text: magenta (#E6007E)
    
    DIGITAL tags (cards 03, 06, 09):
    - Border: yellow 20% opacity
    - Text: yellow-600 (#ca8a04), Add hover effects to solution cards:
    
    CARD HOVER:
    - Background: zinc-50 (#F4F4F5)
    - Transition: 500ms ease
    
    ACTION TEXT (appears on hover):
    - Text: "Learn More" with arrow icon
    - Font-size: 9px
    - Font-weight: 700
    - Uppercase
    - Color: cyan-600 (#0891B2)
    - Default: hidden (opacity 0, shifted down 4px)
    - On hover: visible (opacity 1, normal position)
    - Transition: 300ms, Add large watermark number to each card:
    
    WATERMARK:
    - Same as card ID ("01", "02", etc.)
    - Position: absolute, bottom-right corner
    - Bottom: -32px
    - Right: -16px
    - Font-size: 80px mobile | 120px sm | 160px lg
    - Font-weight: 900
    - Color: black 2% opacity (very faint)
    - On hover: black 4% opacity
    - Transition: 200ms
    - No pointer events
    - Cannot be selected, Add Shopify schema settings:
    
    SECTION SETTINGS:
    - Subheading text (default: "CAPABILITIES")
    - Heading text line 1 (default: "Industrial")
    - Heading text line 2 with accent color (default: "Solutions.")
    - Accent color picker (default: cyan #00B9F1)
    
    BLOCK TYPE "solution_card" (limit 10):
    - ID number (text field)
    - Tag text (text field)
    - Tag color type (dropdown: cyan, magenta, yellow)
    - Card title (text field)
    - Link URL (optional)
    
    Include 10 default blocks with the card data provided., Add header content to the right column:
    
    LABEL ROW:
    - Display: flex, align-items center
    - Gap: 16px
    - Margin-bottom: 24px
    
    Decorative line:
    - Width: 32px
    - Height: 1px
    - Background: yellow (#FFC107)
    
    Label text:
    - Text: "GLOBAL BENCHMARK"
    - Font-size: 9px
    - Font-weight: 900
    - Uppercase
    - Letter-spacing: 0.5em
    - Color: yellow (#FFC107)
    
    MAIN HEADING:
    - Text: "INDUSTRY STANDARDS."
    - Font-size: 36px mobile | 48px md
    - Font-weight: 900
    - Uppercase
    - Letter-spacing: tight
    - Font-style: italic
    - Line-height: 0.9
    - Color: black
    - "STANDARDS." word: magenta (#E6007E)
    - Margin-bottom: 32px
    
    DESCRIPTION:
    - Text: "Global-scale production from the heart of Texas. We bridge the gap between creative UI/UX design and industrial-grade physical media."
    - Font-size: 18px
    - Color: black 40% opacity
    - Font-weight: 300
    - Line-height: 1.625, Add services grid below the description:
    
    SERVICES CONTAINER:
    - Display: grid
    - Columns: 1 (stacked)
    - Gap: 24px
    - Margin-top: 32px
    
    SERVICE ITEM (3 total):
    - Display: flex
    - Gap: 24px
    - Cursor: pointer
    
    Icon box:
    - Width & height: 64px
    - Border-radius: 16px
    - Background: white
    - Border: 1px solid black 10% opacity
    - Display: flex, center content
    - Box-shadow: shadow-sm
    - Flex-shrink: 0
    
    Icon:
    - Size: 20px
    
    Content section:
    - Padding-top: 4px
    
    Title:
    - Font-size: 18px
    - Font-weight: 900
    - Uppercase
    - Letter-spacing: 0.1em
    - Color: black
    
    Description:
    - Font-size: 14px
    - Color: black 40% opacity
    - Font-weight: 300
    - Line-height: 1.625
    - Max-width: 512px
    
    SERVICE DATA:
    1. MousePointer icon (cyan) | "Strategic Design" | "Visual systems designed to scale across digital and print touchpoints."
    2. Sparkle icon (magenta) | "Print-On-Demand" | "Rapid prototyping with industrial-grade output quality."
    3. Globe icon (yellow) | "Digital Performance" | "Analytics-driven optimization for maximum conversion.", Add hover effects to the section:
    
    IMAGE HOVER:
    - Scale: 105% on hover
    - Transition: 2000ms ease
    
    Add gradient overlay on image:
    - Position: absolute, full coverage
    - Gradient: from black 50% opacity at top, to transparent
    - Pointer-events: none
    
    Add background glow behind image:
    - Position: absolute
    - Inset: -80px (extends beyond image)
    - Background: cyan 5% opacity
    - Blur: 100px
    - Border-radius: full circle
    - Z-index: behind image
    
    SERVICE ITEM HOVER:
    Icon box:
    - Background: black on hover
    - Icon color: white on hover
    - Transition: 500ms
    
    Title:
    - Color: cyan-600 (#0891B2) on hover
    - Transition: 200ms, Add settings to customize this section:
    
    Allow editing:
    - Label text
    - Heading text
    - Description text
    - Image
    
    Allow adding service items with:
    - Icon
    - Title
    - Description
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-solutions-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100vw;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_vertical }}px 0;
  }

  .ai-solutions-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-solutions-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 24px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-solutions-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 48px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1280px) {
    .ai-solutions-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 80px;
    }
  }

  .ai-solutions-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-solutions-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 80px;
    }
  }

  .ai-solutions-header-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-solutions-header-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-solutions-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.4em;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-solutions-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-solutions-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 48px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
    .ai-solutions-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 56px;
    }
  }

  .ai-solutions-heading-accent-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  .ai-solutions-underline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 96px;
    height: 6px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .ai-solutions-label-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-solutions-label-line-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 32px;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
  }

  .ai-solutions-label-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5em;
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
  }

  .ai-solutions-right-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 0.9;
    color: {{ block.settings.right_heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 32px 0;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
    .ai-solutions-right-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 48px;
    }
  }

  .ai-solutions-right-heading-accent-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.right_heading_accent_color }};
  }

  .ai-solutions-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.625;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-solutions-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 24px;
  }

  .ai-solutions-image-glow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -80px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.image_glow_color }};
    filter: blur(100px);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ai-solutions-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 24px;
  }

  .ai-solutions-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 2000ms ease;
  }

  .ai-solutions-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-solutions-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .ai-solutions-image-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, {{ block.settings.image_overlay_color }}, transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-solutions-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 24px;
  }

  .ai-solutions-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    max-height: 400px;
  }

  .ai-solutions-services-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .ai-solutions-service-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-solutions-service-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.service_icon_bg }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.service_icon_border }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    transition: background-color 500ms ease, border-color 500ms ease;
  }

  .ai-solutions-service-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-solutions-service-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.service_icon_hover_bg }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.service_icon_hover_bg }};
  }

  .ai-solutions-service-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    transition: stroke 500ms ease;
  }

  .ai-solutions-service-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-solutions-service-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    stroke: {{ block.settings.service_icon_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-solutions-service-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .ai-solutions-service-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: {{ block.settings.service_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    transition: color 200ms ease;
  }

  .ai-solutions-service-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-solutions-service-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.service_title_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-solutions-service-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.service_desc_color }};
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.625;
    max-width: 512px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-solutions-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    border-left: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
    .ai-solutions-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-solutions-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 24px;
    border-right: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    min-height: 200px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: background-color 500ms ease, transform 500ms ease;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-solutions-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 32px;
      min-height: 240px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-solutions-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px;
      min-height: 280px;
    }
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_hover_bg }};
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-top-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-id-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.id_color }};
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.tag_bg_color }};
    border: 1px solid;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-tag-cyan-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.tag_cyan_border }};
    color: {{ block.settings.tag_cyan_text }};
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-tag-magenta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.tag_magenta_border }};
    color: {{ block.settings.tag_magenta_text }};
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-tag-yellow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.tag_yellow_border }};
    color: {{ block.settings.tag_yellow_text }};
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-grow: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-solutions-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-solutions-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-solutions-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-action-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.action_text_color }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(4px);
    transition: opacity 300ms ease, transform 300ms ease;
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-solutions-card-action-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-action-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-watermark-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -32px;
    right: -16px;
    font-size: 80px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: {{ block.settings.watermark_color }};
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
    line-height: 1;
    z-index: 1;
    transition: color 200ms ease;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-solutions-card-watermark-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 120px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-solutions-card-watermark-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 160px;
    }
  }

  .ai-solutions-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-solutions-card-watermark-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.watermark_hover_color }};
  }
{% endstyle %}

<solutions-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-solutions-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-solutions-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-solutions-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-solutions-header-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
          <div class="ai-solutions-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</div>
        {% endif %}
        
        {% if block.settings.heading_line1 != blank or block.settings.heading_line2 != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-solutions-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.heading_line1 }}{% if block.settings.heading_line2 != blank %} <span class="ai-solutions-heading-accent-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading_line2 }}</span>{% endif %}
          </h2>
        {% endif %}
        
        <div class="ai-solutions-underline-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

        {% if block.settings.header_image != blank %}
          <div class="ai-solutions-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-solutions-image-glow-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
            <div class="ai-solutions-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.header_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.header_image.alt | escape }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="{{ block.settings.header_image.width }}"
                height="{{ block.settings.header_image.height }}"
                class="ai-solutions-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
              <div class="ai-solutions-image-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-solutions-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-solutions-header-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.label_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-solutions-label-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-solutions-label-line-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
            <div class="ai-solutions-label-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.label_text }}</div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.right_heading_line1 != blank or block.settings.right_heading_line2 != blank %}
          <h3 class="ai-solutions-right-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.right_heading_line1 }}{% if block.settings.right_heading_line2 != blank %} <span class="ai-solutions-right-heading-accent-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.right_heading_line2 }}</span>{% endif %}
          </h3>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
          <p class="ai-solutions-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.description }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        <div class="ai-solutions-services-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% for i in (1..6) %}
            {% assign icon_key = 'service_' | append: i | append: '_icon' %}
            {% assign icon_color_key = 'service_' | append: i | append: '_icon_color' %}
            {% assign title_key = 'service_' | append: i | append: '_title' %}
            {% assign desc_key = 'service_' | append: i | append: '_description' %}
            
            {% assign icon_type = block.settings[icon_key] %}
            {% assign icon_color_type = block.settings[icon_color_key] %}
            {% assign service_title = block.settings[title_key] %}
            {% assign service_desc = block.settings[desc_key] %}
            
            {% if service_title != blank %}
              {% liquid
                assign icon_color = '#0891B2'
                if icon_color_type == 'magenta'
                  assign icon_color = '#E6007E'
                elsif icon_color_type == 'yellow'
                  assign icon_color = '#ca8a04'
                endif
              %}

              <div class="ai-solutions-service-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-solutions-service-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if icon_type == 'pointer' %}
                    <svg class="ai-solutions-service-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path d="M3 3L10.07 19.97L12.58 12.58L19.97 10.07L3 3Z" stroke="{{ icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% elsif icon_type == 'sparkle' %}
                    <svg class="ai-solutions-service-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z" stroke="{{ icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% elsif icon_type == 'globe' %}
                    <svg class="ai-solutions-service-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="{{ icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                      <path d="M2 12H22" stroke="{{ icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                      <path d="M12 2C14.5013 4.73835 15.9228 8.29203 16 12C15.9228 15.708 14.5013 19.2616 12 22C9.49872 19.2616 8.07725 15.708 8 12C8.07725 8.29203 9.49872 4.73835 12 2Z" stroke="{{ icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% elsif icon_type == 'target' %}
                    <svg class="ai-solutions-service-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="{{ icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6" stroke="{{ icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2" stroke="{{ icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% elsif icon_type == 'layers' %}
                    <svg class="ai-solutions-service-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path d="M12 2L2 7L12 12L22 7L12 2Z" stroke="{{ icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                      <path d="M2 17L12 22L22 17" stroke="{{ icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                      <path d="M2 12L12 17L22 12" stroke="{{ icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% elsif icon_type == 'zap' %}
                    <svg class="ai-solutions-service-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path d="M13 2L3 14H12L11 22L21 10H12L13 2Z" stroke="{{ icon_color }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>
                <div class="ai-solutions-service-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <h4 class="ai-solutions-service-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ service_title }}</h4>
                  {% if service_desc != blank %}
                    <p class="ai-solutions-service-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ service_desc }}</p>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-solutions-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% for i in (1..10) %}
        {% assign card_id_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_id' %}
        {% assign card_tag_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_tag' %}
        {% assign card_color_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_color' %}
        {% assign card_title_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_title' %}
        {% assign card_link_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_link' %}
        
        {% assign card_id = block.settings[card_id_key] %}
        {% assign card_tag = block.settings[card_tag_key] %}
        {% assign card_color = block.settings[card_color_key] %}
        {% assign card_title = block.settings[card_title_key] %}
        {% assign card_link = block.settings[card_link_key] %}
        
        {% if card_title != blank %}
          {% assign tag_class = '' %}
          
          {% if card_color == 'cyan' %}
            {% assign tag_class = 'ai-solutions-card-tag-cyan-' | append: ai_gen_id %}
          {% elsif card_color == 'magenta' %}
            {% assign tag_class = 'ai-solutions-card-tag-magenta-' | append: ai_gen_id %}
          {% elsif card_color == 'yellow' %}
            {% assign tag_class = 'ai-solutions-card-tag-yellow-' | append: ai_gen_id %}
          {% endif %}
          
          {% if card_link != blank %}
            <a href="{{ card_link }}" class="ai-solutions-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-solutions-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% endif %}
            <div class="ai-solutions-card-watermark-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_id }}</div>
            
            <div class="ai-solutions-card-top-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if card_id != blank %}
                <div class="ai-solutions-card-id-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_id }}</div>
              {% endif %}
              {% if card_tag != blank %}
                <div class="ai-solutions-card-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }} {{ tag_class }}">{{ card_tag }}</div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="ai-solutions-card-bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-solutions-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_title }}</h3>
              <div class="ai-solutions-card-action-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <span>{{ block.settings.action_text }}</span>
                <svg class="ai-solutions-card-action-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <path d="M1 8H15M15 8L8 1M15 8L8 15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          {% if card_link != blank %}
            </a>
          {% else %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</solutions-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class SolutionsGrid{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.style.display = 'block';
      }
    }

    customElements.define('solutions-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}', SolutionsGrid{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

